        "dropdown_tXrpKQ": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BOGO BONUS: LIMITED TIME",
            "text": "<h3>Business Blueprint Course</h3><p>Our new Wellness Business Course includes 10 modules of practical video lessons to give you the confidence, knowledge, support and resources to build and grow your dream online business, all as you’re learning.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $2,990 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/wbc-offerblock-3.png",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Highlights Include:</p><ul><li>Our proven step-by-step formula that we personally use at Food Matters so that you can start getting paid for doing work that you love, even if you’re short on ideas, money & time. </li><li>Learn mindset, products, story, ideal customers, digital marketing, crafting an unbeatable offer, social media, email marketing and so much more!</li><li><em><strong>INCLUDED FREE FOR A LIMITED TIME ONLY</strong></em></li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#f9dfcf",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_NJmJHk": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BOGO BONUS: LIMITED TIME",
            "text": "<h3>Nutrition Coach Accelerator Program</h3><p>This program is packed with workshops, tutorials, and templates to turn your certification into real-world success. Learn how to start and grow a thriving online wellness business that provides the freedom and life you want!</p><p><strong>Valued at: $990 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/product-1200-800.png",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Highlights Include:</p><ul><li>Our proven step-by-step formula that we personally use at Food Matters so that you can start getting paid for doing work that you love, even if you’re short on ideas, money & time. </li><li>Learn mindset, products, story, ideal customers, digital marketing, crafting an unbeatable offer, social media, email marketing and so much more!</li><li><em><strong>INCLUDED FREE FOR A LIMITED TIME ONLY</strong></em></li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#f9dfcf",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "3261359c-4ce5-4be1-a908-1aa1f1e1bac5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #1 GRADUATE COURSE",
            "text": "<h3>The Ultimate Business Bootcamp</h3><p>This program is packed with workshops, tutorials, and templates to turn your certification into real-world success. Learn how to start and grow a thriving online wellness business that provides the freedom and life you want!</p><p><strong>Valued at: $990 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-free-masterclass.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Highlights Include:</p><ul><li>Coaching Fundamentals with Christa Orecchio</li><li>How to Build a Conscious Business Online with James Colquhoun</li><li>How to Start Your Own World-Class Podcast with Melissa Ambrosini & Nick Broadhurst</li><li>Overcoming Limiting Beliefs with Marie Forleo</li><li>How to Create a Recipe eBook with Renae Barrington</li><li>How to Start a Successful Blog with Elizabeth Rider</li><li>And so much more!</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "f5938453-db6a-4623-a83b-d73529cf89af": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #1 WORKBOOK",
            "text": "<h3><strong>FREE Hard Copy Program Workbook Shipped to Your Door</strong></h3><p>Receive a copy of the third edition printed workbook shipped to your door, no matter where you are in the world. This workbook is a guide to help you follow the self-paced lessons with ease and reinforce your learnings.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $159</strong> - Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-workbook-cover.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46ac2460-c747-4067-823b-d062702f351e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #1 FOOD MATTERS SIGNATURE PROGRAM",
            "text": "<h3><strong>21 Days of Healthy Meal Plans, Shopping Lists, and Recipes</strong></h3><p>This practical program is designed to take the guesswork and expensive costs out of healthy eating while healing your gut, shifting stubborn weight, and getting your time back in the kitchen. You won't have to think about what to eat for the next 3 weeks!</p><p><strong>Valued at: $299</strong> - Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-bundle-clean-eating-landscape.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "6b7d24e3-8868-4464-9e76-e240561f2e17": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #2 FOOD MATTERS SIGNATURE PROGRAM",
            "text": "<h3><strong>7 Days of Detoxification Focused Recipes & Shopping Lists</strong></h3><p>Reset your body, say goodbye to bloat, help support your body’s natural detoxification ability with specific recipes, shopping lists, and more designed to help you feel better and lighter instantly.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $199</strong> - Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-bundle-juice-detox-landscape.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "c44c4c41-f434-44a2-94de-5c5db501bf27": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #4 LIVE ONLINE Q&As",
            "text": "<h3><strong>3x Live Q&As with Institute Founder & In-House Nutritionist</strong></h3><p>As you begin the program, it’s normal to have lots of questions and be seeking extra guidance. We’re providing that support in real-time with 3 intimate Q&A sessions with Food Matters Institute Co-Founder, Laurentine and our in-house nutritionist and student advisor, Kayla. (Recordings available if you’re unable to attend the sessions live.)</p><p><strong>Valued at: $498</strong> - Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-online-live-qa-lk.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "3005b079-faea-4841-8f59-d85174583940": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #3 DIGITAL ACCESS PACK",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Guide to the Top Secrets for Longevity and Healthy Aging</strong></h3><p>Join Brian Vaszily as you learn the secrets to longevity and healthy aging from 21 of the world’s most renowned longevity and healthy aging doctors and health professionals. These natural solutions will teach you how to live long and live well. You’ll discover secrets to combat and avoid disease and experience peak brain power, energy, moods, skin, and more.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $197 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert23-bonus-art-of-anti-aging_1.png",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "2b19893f-34d3-4cc6-ad6b-4fe642097518": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #4 MEDITATION SERIES",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Daily Meditations with Institute Co-Founder</strong></h3><p>Overcome limiting beliefs and self-acceptance with these short meditations designed by Laurentine ten Bosch to help you transform your mind.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $49 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-laurentine-meditation.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "1058864f-074b-4001-a3ab-9b7ebdddc762": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #5 COOKING SERIES",
            "text": "<h3>Gut Healing & Immune Boosting Cooking Series for Beginners</h3><p>Join Chef Teton over five seasons of her popular series: Essential Cuisine. Through visual demonstrations, she’s going to teach you how to apply practical knowledge in the kitchen. Get ready to learn: raw food basics, how to cook a variety of dishes, how to use oils, and even about cultured vegetables and kefir. No matter your ability level, Chef Teton makes healthy cooking easy and fun!</p><p><strong>Valued at: $97 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-chef-teton.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "273959c3-5bb7-4f82-8330-669c9628a477": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #6 EXPERT HACKS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>How to Turn Your Big Dreams Into Reality</strong></h3><p>What would you do for your health and wellbeing if you couldn’t fail? Hear from expert Kristina Karlsson on how she turned her dreams into a world-wide movement by focusing on her values and purpose.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-the-art-of-dreaming-big.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "c5fb8ede-a464-4fa0-892b-fa5bf0efeced": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #7 EXPERT HACKS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>How to Create a Healthy Brain and Unlock Your Inner Power</strong></h3><p>Join Jim Kwik as he shares secrets of how he overcame some of the biggest challenges life gave him by learning how to optimize his brain.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-unlocking-the-power-of-your-mind.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "915071d1-8fc9-4ce6-884c-c4e1917de0e7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #8 EXPERT HACKS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>How to Start and Monetize a Successful Nutrition Blog Now!</strong></h3><p>Elizabeth Rider teaches you the practical steps to starting a blog, turning it into a business, and charting a career path with  all of the steps in between.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $199 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-how-to-start-a-successful-blog.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "e57e1e66-e636-4759-b6c6-34b7f76794be": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #9 HOW-TO GUIDE",
            "text": "<h3>Understanding Inflammation to Heal More Effectively</h3><p>Join Dr. Christine Smith as she shares the essential components your body needs to heal from an injury and prevent the cascade of events that often follow.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-christine-webinar.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "61348ad9-5e77-4e47-9496-ba57e3203422": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #10 HOW-TO GUIDE",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Create a Recipe eBook from Start to Finish with These Simple Steps</strong></h3><p>Use this practical guide to see how easy it is to turn your collection of recipes into an eBook to share with others.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $49 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-how-to-create-your-own-recipe-ebook.png",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "5b7d0526-baae-42b0-a697-96a56aa84144": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #11 HEALING TOOLS",
            "text": "<h3>Expert Healing Toolbox</h3><p>Dive deeper into healing with Dr. David Jockers and Jason Prall, and use these recipes and protocols designed to help you incorporate foods that fight inflammation and rituals to help you sleep better than you have in years.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $29 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-healing-toolbox.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "6e89b521-888a-4706-adb0-58b3b1b29f5f": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #12 HEALTHY EATING TOOLS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Food Matters Healthy Eating Toolbox</strong></h3><p>We’ve taken the thinking and effort out of eating healthy with these eBooks, recipe books, checklists, and tools designed to make natural living and eating easy for you.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $59 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-ebooklibrary-600x400.png",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "2ced7736-48c9-4eb6-bdca-52c6ae54aff6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #13 PRINT OUT",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Healthy & Affordable Recipe eBook</strong></h3><p>Think eating healthy requires spending extra money? Think again! These are some of our favorite recipes to make for anybody who is looking to eat healthy diet on a budget. AND, they are equally as delicious.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $19 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-healthyrecipes-ebook-600x400.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "8e103c19-1a17-4d3d-a0d4-2a1db0007200": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #14 EXPERT HACKS",
            "text": "<h3>Bonus Nutrition Masterclasses with Leading Experts</h3><p>Join some of the world’s leading experts on nutrition and natural healing as they dive into topics of expertise like hormones, gut health, inflammation, emotional eating, detoxification, and more.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-nutrition-masterclass.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "6bc6969e-e694-478d-b773-59e704216932": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #15 EXCLUSIVE ACCESS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Lifetime Access to the Program</strong></h3><p>You’ll get lifetime access to the program, meaning no strict timeframes or due dates. Plus, you can revisit the lessons as often as you’d like! Use the program as a reference tool in your everyday life and so you can help your family and friends.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $999 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-lifetimeaccess-450x350.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "570c0c73-cac1-469b-a62e-976388199fb1": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #16 STUDY HACK",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Easy to Follow Lesson Transcripts</strong></h3><p>We’ve included word-for-word transcripts of every lesson to reinforce the concepts you are learning and provide an easy point of reference. These are especially great if you like to follow along and highlight key points you want to remember.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $129 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-lessontranscripts-450x350.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "9d9f367a-a477-4cee-8f5b-e9965a9c3d39": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #17 EXCLUSIVE ACCESS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Ongoing Live Chat, Email & Text Support</strong></h3><p>Get one-click support from our student advisors and in-house nutritionist to answer all your questions. The support doesn’t stop when you finish the program, it’s ongoing as you get lifetime access!</p><p><strong>Valued at: $299 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-livechat-450x350.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "9fe86c55-f3f6-4dfb-8f04-4e7558fcfb1c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #18 EXCLUSIVE ACCESS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Free Program Upgrades</strong></h3><p>Our team is constantly working to keep the program up to date, relevant, and simply the best on the market. You’ll receive access to ALL new content, lessons, bonuses, and features added to the program in the future. FREE!</p><p><strong>Valued at: $499 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-programupdates-2-450x350.png",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "251044ce-2c3b-48f6-97cc-1483703df12a": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #19 FILMS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Food Matters Film Library</strong></h3><p>Gain access to the Food Matters film pack, including Food Matters, Hungry for Change, and Transcendence 1 & 2.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cert-bonus-films.png",
