      "settings": {
        "title": "Program Accreditations",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "subheading": "The Food Matters Nutrition Certification Course is recognized by the below organizations: National Board for Health and Wellness Coaching (NBHWC) This course is an approved health & wellness coach training program for continuing education of National Board Certified Health and Wellness Coaches (NBC-HWCs). Qualifying graduates can receive 32 CE/CPD credits through NBHWC. International Institute for Complementary Therapists (IICT)Successful graduates qualify for membership and insurance through IICT under the Nutrition Consultant modality for practice in 35+ countries (including the USA, Australia, Canada, and UK). International Approval and Registration Centre (IARC)The Food Matters Institute is recognized for quality excellence in education.",
        "align_heading": "center",
        "cta_button": "Enroll Now",
        "cta_button_url": "#offer",
        "cta_button_entitled": "Enroll Now",
        "cta_button_url_entitled": "#offer",
