    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How long will it take to complete the program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The program is made up of ten modules and we recommend dedicating approximately 5 hours to completing each module, making the program easy to complete in less than 6 months. Because the program is 100% online and accessible 24/7 with no lecture commitments, you can start when you're ready, and complete it around your own schedule or downtime after work.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Is the program accredited?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program is recognized by the International Approval and Registration Centre (IARC), and is an approved training provider with the International Institute for Complementary Therapists (IICT). This means our graduates qualify for membership and insurance through IICT under the Nutrition Consultant modality.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What diet philosophy is taught inside the program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The content within this program doesn't adhere to any one specific diet or way of eating, and this is because we believe in bio-individuality and that there is no one-size-fits-all approach when it comes to nutrition and health.<br/>The program emphasizes consuming a primarily plant-based diet because there is strong evidence for the benefits of consuming a large variety of plant-based foods.<br/>There is content discussing how to ethically include quality animal products in your diet for those who choose to (or for those who find themselves coaching clients who choose to).<br/><br/>Ultimately we focus on giving students a deep understanding of the foundations required for optimal health and nutrition and the science behind food, nutrition, and many of the key systems in the body. We believe that once you have this foundational knowledge, it's much easier to interpret and implement information on health and nutrition!</p><h3></h3>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I study at my own pace?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes. The Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program is designed to be completed at your own pace, from the comfort of your own home. You have lifetime access to the program, so you can jump into each lesson when you're ready.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "64c54989-1338-47b7-bd63-ddfa422511b7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is a Food Matters Nutrition Consultant?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>A Nutrition Consultant is a certified consultant who has a deep knowledge of basic nutrition principles and the skills required to provide nutrition guidance to their clients. Embodying core principles of holistic nutrition and natural medicine using a food as medicine approach to educate and guide their clients (and themselves) to help them achieve their nutrition and health goals and reach optimal health.</p><h3></h3>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "19434ac0-1bc8-4fa7-9407-033dd509cb20": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What if I don't like the program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Our priority is the happiness of our customers, so if you aren't 100% satisfied with the program, you can email us for a full refund within 14 days. We have a money-back guarantee, no questions asked.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "195adf6e-7d69-4458-9adb-eaa295bb77f4": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Will I have access to support?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes! You'll be supported by our incredible Student Support Team and Certification Program coordinator (a qualified nutritionist) via live chat, email, or Whatsapp. You'll also have access to a thriving online student community where you'll be supported by peers from around the world who are working through the program with you. If you would like extra support, you can also join one of our guided intakes where you will study alongside a group of peers and our student advisor.</p><h3></h3>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "78097ffe-c976-4945-a965-5f25431986b6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How long do I have access to the program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>You have lifetime access to the program including all future program updates meaning you can start when you're ready and complete it around your own schedule.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "ba6c8e79-47b1-4fea-9b1b-6118ceaef2f2": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Will I be able to take a test and earn a certificate after completing this program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes. To complete this program and earn the Food Matters Nutrition Consultant Certificate, you must complete each lesson and pass each module quiz by gaining 80% or higher. You can retake each quiz more than once.<br/><br/>As a student, you will have ongoing access to our entire support team and our Certification Program coordinator (a qualified nutritionist) to help support your success.</p><h3></h3>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "2d40ad68-b191-42bf-8bea-0cc545f7f945": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What will the Food Matters Nutrition Consultant Certificate allow me to do in my business?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program equips students with the knowledge and tools needed to take control of their health and an avenue to launch a career in the public health and wellness space. There are endless options when it comes to using your Nutrition Consultant Certificate and the Bonus Business Module & Coaching Guide, which will help give you some ideas around how you can use the certification in your business.<br/><br/>Generally, Nutrition Consultants do not require a state license to practice and can be certified through private credentialing bodies such as Food Matters. However, it is recommended that you check with licensing authorities in your country and locality before offering any service to the public. The Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program is designed to provide in-depth knowledge and understanding of nutrition, natural healing, and the mind-body connection. You will earn the Food Matters Nutrition Consultant certificate by completing our program, confirming that you have completed our program. Our program does not make you a state-registered dietician or licensed nutritionist. To determine applicable licensing requirements, you will need to check with state and local agencies where you conduct your business and where your clients reside.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "01a99bc2-294d-4b01-ab25-9f437bd868c6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What does lifetime access to the program include?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Lifetime access to the programs means that you will always be able to access your account and the program. Each year, we add in new and exciting lessons and bonuses, which you will also have access to!</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "bb05ac79-bf67-48e3-ad77-1dd335392d94": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What are continuing education credits?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Health coaches belonging to the National Board for Health & Wellness Coaching (NBHWC) are encouraged to review, advance, and enhance professional knowledge, practice, and skills by gaining Continuing Education Credits (CE credits) from third-party programs and courses. This means that if you are a health coach under the NBHWC you will be eligible to receive CE credits upon completion of the Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "2d640ced-1117-4913-99c0-156ddce29838": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "link": "#offer",
            "link_text": "Enroll Now",
            "link_entitled": "#offer",
            "link_text_entitled": "",
            "align_button": "center"
          }
        },
        "3d4d5aae-2223-42d0-8dc4-411d1eb43905": {
          "type": "text",
